| BIS, IMF, Banxico, BlackRock | tested URLs | Not working at the tested URL (JS challenge, 403, 400, 404). Find the right endpoint before ruling them out |

Bank and asset manager research (Goldman, Morgan Stanley, BofA, JPMorgan Eye on the Market, BlackRock, Apollo, PIMCO, Oaktree) mostly has no RSS. The source list in the `institutional-research-weekly` skill is the starting catalog; each needs its own page check.

